"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "Both MS and Citi explicitly mention using industry best practices and global regulations to design and assess their controls. MS states its program 'takes into account industry best practices' and is assessed against 'global cybersecurity regulations' (ms_2024_7_P392_S001, ms_2024_7_P392_S002). Citi confirms its program is 'supported by comprehensive governance, including policies, standards and procedures that dictate requirements and best practices... [and] regulatory compliance' (c_2024_7_P570_S001). Both companies align their control environments with external regulatory standards, though Citi specifically highlights the role of a Board-approved Risk Appetite Statement in leveraging these frameworks (c_2024_7_P570_S002).",
